    @sent kaye "Who told you I have red glasses?"
    ~ p_kaye_reply = "asked_glasses"
    ~ asked_kaye_glasses = true
    Nothing comes back. It's nearly midnight. She'll have sent it and gone to bed.
* [text] "Can I answer you properly in the morning?"
    @sent kaye "Can I answer you properly in the morning?"
    ~ p_kaye_reply = "deferred"
    ~ p_kaye_morning = "made"
